tifactCreate/Out`, `ScanCreate/Out`, `FindingOut`, `RemediationCreate/Update/Out`, `RiskReport`, `ThreatIntelCreate/Out`, `DashboardStats`\n- **`backend/app/core/scanner.py`** — Full `SecurityScanner` class with:\n  - Threat intel matching (14 seeded known-bad packages including log4shell, xz-utils, event-stream, etc.)\n  - Dependency confusion detection via internal-name heuristics\n  - Version anomaly detection\n  - Hash integrity checking\n  - Build secret detection (10 regex patterns: AWS keys, GitHub tokens, Bearer tokens, JDBC URLs, private keys, etc.)\n  - Missing SLSA provenance detection\n  - Artifact tamper/unsigned detection\n  - Supply chain depth analysis (flags transitive deps at depth ≥5)\n  - Risk score calculation (weighted, 0–100)\n  - CycloneDX-style SBOM generation\n  - `seed_threat_intel()` to populate DB on startup\n- **`backend/app/api/projects.py`** — CRUD endpoints: `GET /projects`, `POST /projects`, `GET /projects/{id}`, `PATCH /projects/{id}`, `DELETE /projects/{id}`\n- **`backend/app/api/dependencies.py`** — `GET/POST /projects/{id}/dependencies`, `POST /projects/{id}/dependencies/bulk`, `GET/DELETE /projects/{id}/dependencies/{dep_id}`\n- **`backend/app/api/scans.py`** — `GET/POST /projects/{id}/scans`, `GET /projects/{id}/scans/{scan_id}`, `GET .../findings`, `GET /findings/{id}`, `GET/POST /findings/{id}/remediations`, `PATCH /remediations/{id}`, `GET /projects/{id}/report`. Background task pattern for scan execution.\n- **`backend/app/api/builds.py`** — `GET/POST /projects/{id}/builds`, `PATCH .../complete`, `GET/POST /projects/{id}/artifacts`, `PATCH .../artifacts/{id}/verify` (checksum comparison)\n- **`backend/app/api/dashboard.py`** — `GET /dashboard` (aggregated stats), `GET/POST/DELETE /threat-intel`\n- **`backend/main.py`** — FastAPI app with lifespan (calls `init_db()` + `seed_threat_intel()`), CORS enabled for `localhost:5173`, all routers mounted at `/api/v1`\n\n### Frontend (PARTIAL)\n- **`frontend/src/api/client.ts`** — Ty